        "status": "present",
        "value": "The tokenizer splits on spaces and single-character symbols, grouping alphanumeric runs. expr calls term and folds + and - by merging maps with sign +1 or -1; term calls factor and folds * by pairwise multiplication; factor consumes a number, a name (constant if bound, else a one-variable monomial) or a parenthesised expr. Both candidates filter zero coefficients after every combine and multiply, then sort by (-len(key), key) and format coefficient plus '*name' parts."
      },
